# One line ending, everywhere.
#
# Git was handing this checkout CRLF on Windows while CI read LF, so code that
# read a file — the exclusions twin parser, the stylesheets inlined into every
# route page — behaved differently on the machine the human walks from than in
# the pipeline. Two gates were green in CI and red here before this line
# (2026-09-10). Text files are stored and checked out with LF on every
# platform; the parsers stay defensive, but they no longer carry the product
# alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
